              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shamagâ, muana mulume wa Anata, wakabika ku nyima kuandi, yeye wakashiha Bena Peleshete nkama isambombo ne mutshi wa kusaka nʼau ngombe; yeye wakasungila Bena Isalele kabidi.",
